aysinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351240/extras/7c5fb897de237eb968646db234c04929.poster.avif?t=1775568873\" width=614 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351240/extras/7c5fb897de237eb968646db234c04929.webm?t=1775568873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351240/extras/7c5fb897de237eb968646db234c04929.mp4?t=1775568873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Meet your passengers' requests: chat, change the radio station, open the window, etc.<br></li><li>Provide impeccable service to earn tips and excellent reviews</li></ul></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351240/extras/ccc4a902489dda63945c0c4d9f46a62b.poster.avif?t=1775568873\" width=614 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351240/extras/ccc4a902489dda63945c0c4d9f46a62b.webm?t=1775568873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351240/extras/ccc4a902489dda63945c0c4d9f46a62b.mp4?t=1775568873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351240/extras/a82f9b5119d06f86deb920aee6c7aac1.poster.avif?t=1775568873\" width=614 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351240/extras/a82f9b5119d06f86deb920aee6c7aac1.webm?t=1775568873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https: